{
  "version": 1,
  "about": "agentic-cli's shipped model table: family rules (first match wins, per provider) and per-model numbers. Live listings and the user's endpoint declarations take precedence over every value here.",
  "providers": {
    "google": {
      "fallback_models": [
        "gemini-3.1-pro-preview",
        "gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview",
        "gemini-2.5-pro",
        "gemini-2.5-flash"
      ],
      "fallback_source": "agentic-cli 0.6.x ModelRegistry.FALLBACK_GOOGLE",
      "rules": [
        {
          "match": "^gemini-2\\.5-flash-lite(-preview(-[0-9-]+)?)?$",
          "tier": "fast",
          "thinking": {
            "mechanism": "gemini_budget",
            "budgets": [4096, 12288, 24576],
            "budget_range": [512, 24576],
            "can_disable": true
          },
          "cache": "gemini",
          "reasoning_text": true,
          "sampling": "always",
          "source": "Gemini 2.5 flash-lite: budget thinking, 512-24576, and 0 turns thinking off. agentic-cli 0.6.x budgets for low/medium/high (adk/manager.py, langgraph/graph_builder.py); budget range from the Gemini API thinking guide (ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/thinking), as the profiles carry no budget ranges"
        },
        {
          "match": "^gemini-2\\.5-flash(-preview(-[0-9-]+)?)?$",
          "tier": "default",
          "thinking": {
            "mechanism": "gemini_budget",
            "budgets": [4096, 12288, 24576],
            "budget_range": [1, 24576],
            "can_disable": true
          },
          "cache": "gemini",
          "reasoning_text": true,
          "sampling": "always",
          "source": "Gemini 2.5 flash: budget thinking, 1-24576, and 0 turns thinking off. agentic-cli 0.6.x budgets for low/medium/high (adk/manager.py, langgraph/graph_builder.py); budget range from the Gemini API thinking guide (ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/thinking), as the profiles carry no budget ranges"
        },
        {
          "match": "^gemini-2\\.5-pro(-preview(-[0-9-]+)?)?$",
          "tier": "strong",
          "thinking": {
            "mechanism": "gemini_budget",
            "budgets": [4096, 12288, 24576],
            "budget_range": [128, 32768],
            "can_disable": false
          },
          "cache": "gemini",
          "reasoning_text": true,
          "sampling": "always",
          "source": "Gemini 2.5 pro: budget thinking, 128-32768, and thinking cannot be turned off. agentic-cli 0.6.x budgets for low/medium/high (adk/manager.py, langgraph/graph_builder.py); budget range from the Gemini API thinking guide (ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/thinking), as the profiles carry no budget ranges"
        },
        {
          "match": "^gemini-[3-9](\\.\\d+)?-pro(-preview(-[0-9-]+)?)?$",
          "tier": "strong",
          "thinking": {
            "mechanism": "gemini_level",
            "levels": ["low", "high"],
            "can_disable": false,
            "generic_map": {
              "medium": "high"
            }
          },
          "cache": "gemini",
          "reasoning_text": true,
          "sampling": "always",
          "source": "Gemini 3 Pro: levels low and high only, medium becomes high. Gemini 3 and later take a discrete thinking_level and cannot turn thinking off (none = the lowest level); agentic-cli 0.6.x thinking-level mapping; ladders from the langchain-google-genai 4.4.2 bundled profiles (models.dev, MIT), 2026-10"
        },
        {
          "match": "^gemini-[3-9](\\.\\d+)?-flash-lite(-preview(-[0-9-]+)?)?$",
          "tier": "fast",
          "thinking": {
            "mechanism": "gemini_level",
            "levels": ["minimal", "low", "medium", "high"],
            "can_disable": false
          },
          "cache": "gemini",
          "reasoning_text": true,
          "sampling": "always",
          "source": "Gemini 3 Flash-Lite. Gemini 3 and later take a discrete thinking_level and cannot turn thinking off (none = the lowest level); agentic-cli 0.6.x thinking-level mapping; ladders from the langchain-google-genai 4.4.2 bundled profiles (models.dev, MIT), 2026-10"
        },
        {
          "match": "^gemini-[3-9](\\.\\d+)?-flash(-preview(-[0-9-]+)?)?$",
          "tier": "default",
          "thinking": {
            "mechanism": "gemini_level",
            "levels": ["minimal", "low", "medium", "high"],
            "can_disable": false
          },
          "cache": "gemini",
          "reasoning_text": true,
          "sampling": "always",
          "source": "Gemini 3 Flash. Gemini 3 and later take a discrete thinking_level and cannot turn thinking off (none = the lowest level); agentic-cli 0.6.x thinking-level mapping; ladders from the langchain-google-genai 4.4.2 bundled profiles (models.dev, MIT), 2026-10"
        },
        {
          "match": "^gemini-[3-9]",
          "thinking": {
            "mechanism": "gemini_level",
            "levels": ["low", "high"],
            "can_disable": false,
            "generic_map": {
              "medium": "high"
            }
          },
          "cache": "gemini",
          "reasoning_text": true,
          "sampling": "always",
          "source": "Other Gemini 3+ models: no tier; the levels every Gemini 3 model takes. Gemini 3 and later take a discrete thinking_level and cannot turn thinking off (none = the lowest level); agentic-cli 0.6.x thinking-level mapping; ladders from the langchain-google-genai 4.4.2 bundled profiles (models.dev, MIT), 2026-10"
        }
